The Monks Guild and the        NannyMUD Times                         Page 6
Power of Resurrection

by Noble

  I will talk about partying first.
  Monks are gifted with the ability to heal and make special potions.
  One thing to keep in mind when partying is that monks are only 
  instruments of Lars. A monk can die in a party and the person wishing 
  to be healed can die. First set a reasonable wimpy. You need to know 
  when to leave the room. Some monsters can hit over 100 hp and a monk 
  cannot protect you from that kind of hit if you are down to less than
  that.
  
  Know the monsters habits so you can warn the monk who may not have met the
  monster before. Allow time for the monk to make aliases which will make 
  success more likely.

  Keep an eye on your hp and sp even though the monk is, you are the 
  party leader and responsible for the party. Let the monk know which 
  you need the most healing hp or sp with each guild is different.
  
  Tell the monk exits so they can leave if being attacked (very saintly 
  monks get attacked unprovoked especially when the monster realizes they 
  are healing the fighter.) Monkpeace and stop fight dont always work and 
  don't work well with some monsters. A dead monk cannot heal you.

  Being a monk is not like being a doctor, we are not always on call. We have
  quests to conquer and other monkish duties to perform and want to have fun
  like the rest of you addicted Nannyites :).

  Now let's talk about resurrection.
  Monks cannot resurrect Vampires or Vikings. If you want to be resurrected 
  you should check monk availability before fighting. Talk to the Monk 
  briefly to be sure he or she is not idle and is willing to resurrect you.
  Don't panic. Never leave the place where you die. If a monk is available 
  give directions to the spot from the green with a tell to a guild member 
  or line member or the monk so the monk can find you. A monk can then go 
  to the place resurrect you and you can leave the room quickly or bring 
  the corpse from the room and resurrect you nearby. Moving a corpse is 
  tricky due to items being carried by player. Time is of the essence since 
  bodies decay rapidly and resurrection in the room with a corpse brings 
  the best results. More of your original stats will be restored if corpse 
  it still intact and in the room, however if that's not possible it's 
  still better than praying.

